unsf
------------------------------------------
Converts SoundFont .sf2 files into GUS-type instrument patches

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libunsf-devel-1.1.0+git20201107-1bl2
  libunsf0-1.1.0+git20201107-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/psi29a/unsf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/psi29a/unsf.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack unsf-1.1.0+git20201107-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./unsf-1.1.0+git20201107-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/unsf-1.1.0+git20201107-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/unsf-1.1.0+git20201107-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunsf0-1.1.0+git20201107-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunsf-devel-1.1.0+git20201107-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(unsf)
  /usr/bin/unsf.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/unsf.README
  /usr/share/doc/unsf/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/unsf/README.md

(libunsf0)
  /usr/bin/cygunsf-1.dll

(libunsf-devel)
  /usr/include/libunsf.h
  /usr/lib/libunsf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/unsf.pc

------------------

